<InteriorLayout title="Website Terms | I.S Design + Build" description="Information about project inquiries, photographs, illustrations and the use of this website." label="Website terms" headline="Website terms.">
  <Fragment slot="intro"><p>This website introduces our services and helps you begin a project conversation.</p><p class="guide-byline">Last updated 15 November 2026</p></Fragment>
  <section class="copy-section"><p class="cg-label">Using this website</p><div class="copy-body"><h2>Project information</h2><p>Website information is general. A project-specific review is needed to establish feasibility, scope, estimates, scheduling and any approvals. A website inquiry does not create a construction contract, confirm an appointment or authorize work.</p><h2>Inquiries and availability</h2><p>The project form sends your details to us when it can. If it cannot, it tells you so and prepares the same message for you to send from your own email app. Sending the form does not book a visit. Call <a href="tel:+12025191831">(202) 519-1831</a> to discuss a time-sensitive concern and confirm availability.</p><h2>Photography and illustrations</h2><p>Photographs marked “Our project” and the portfolio come from the company’s project archive. Images labelled “Stock image” and the background video footage are not company projects. Drawings, including the floor plans and the line drawings over photographs, are illustrations.</p><h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about the website or a project, email <a href="mailto:info@isenterprises.net">info@isenterprises.net</a>. Project terms are established in the relevant project documents.</p></div></section>
</InteriorLayout>
